Description: Provides a modular 'Shiny' interface for importing, checking,
    preparing, exploring, analysing, and reproducibly exporting personal light
    exposure data with 'LightLogR'. The application keeps imported data
    unchanged, makes consequential analysis settings explicit, and supports
    recoverable workflows for diverse device exports.
